# Introduction

## The Data
The data used in this project come from the Heart Disease dataset available through the UCI Machine Learning Repository. The dataset contains information on 303 patients, including demographic and health-related characteristics such as age, sex, chest pain type, resting blood pressure, cholesterol, maximum heart rate, and heart disease status. The goal of this analysis is to describe the characteristics of patients in the dataset and examine how selected health characteristics differ between patients with and without heart disease. I use descriptive statistics and visualizations to explore the data.

## Objectives
1. Load and inspect the Heart Disease dataset.
2. Describe the characteristics of patients with and without heart disease.
3. Compare selected health characteristics between the two groups.
4. Visualize differences in age by heart disease status.

