# Table 1: Patient Characteristics by Heart Disease Status

```{r}
table1 <- readRDS(
  file = here::here("output/table1.rds")
)
table1
```

Table 1 summarizes the characteristics of patients with and without heart disease: the number of patients in each group and the mean age, cholesterol level, resting blood pressure, and maximum heart rate.

# Figure 1: Age by Heart Disease Status

```{r}
include_graphics("output/figure1_age_boxplot.png")
```

Figure 1 compares the distribution of age between patients with and without heart disease. The boxplots show the median and spread of age within each group.

